{"id": "s-0151", "domain": "graph theory", "names": ["A", "B", "C"], "text": "For my discrete math homework I need all the circles to be blue. Then connect A to B and B to C with arrows, so we get a little path. Tell me whether there's a path from A to C, and how many connections the diagram has.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,shape=circle)", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "A,B,C", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "A", "to": "C"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}]}
{"id": "s-0152", "domain": "bakery", "names": ["Oven", "Counter"], "text": "The bakery needs a new fridge. Create a white square called Fridge to the left of the Oven. Then take the new square and make it big, cold storage takes space. Connect Counter to it with a dotted line, and tell me what colour the Fridge is.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "color": "white", "name": "Fridge", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Oven"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "$new", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Counter", "to": "$new", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "$new", "property": "color"}}]}
{"id": "s-0153", "domain": "evacuation plan", "names": ["Exit1", "Exit2", "Stairs"], "text": "We rehearse a fire drill on Friday and the plan has to be clear. Make both exits green, and let the Stairs be red because they are closed. Move the red one to the bottom and shrink it. Then count the green shapes for me.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Exit1,Exit2", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Stairs", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "mention(color=red)", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "mention(color=red)"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "color": "green"}}]}
{"id": "s-0154", "domain": "social network", "names": ["Mia", "Leo", "Zoe"], "text": "Mia follows Leo, and Leo follows Zoe, but Zoe doesn't follow anyone. Draw the arrows that way. Mia is the influencer here, so make her gold and huge. Is Zoe the least connected person?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Mia,Leo,Zoe", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mia", "color": "gold", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leastConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0155", "domain": "kubernetes", "names": ["Ingress", "Pod1", "Pod2"], "text": "Ingress fans out to the pods, so link it to Pod1 and Pod2. I need one extra pod, so duplicate Pod2 and move the copy below Pod2. Colour the copy gray, since it isn't ready yet. Which shape is closest to Ingress?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Ingress", "to": "Pod1,Pod2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Pod2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "$new", "position": "below", "anchor": "Pod2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "$new", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Ingress", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0156", "domain": "tabletop rpg", "names": ["Party", "Dragon", "Hoard"], "text": "hey, my players are about to meet the dragon so i need the Dragon massive and red. Hoard goes right under it, as gold. then connect the Party to the Dragon with a dashed arrow, since they're sneaking in. are there any stars on the map?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dragon", "size": "huge", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Hoard", "position": "below", "anchor": "Dragon"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hoard", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Party", "to": "Dragon", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "shape": "star"}}]}
{"id": "s-0157", "domain": "legal process", "names": ["Filing", "Hearing", "Verdict"], "text": "A case goes from Filing to Hearing to Verdict, nothing else. Please draw those two arrows. The Hearing step is where most of the delay is, so highlight it in orange. And if you can, tell me if the Verdict is the rightmost.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Filing,Hearing,Verdict", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hearing", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Verdict", "position": "right"}}]}
{"id": "s-0158", "domain": "shape sorting game", "names": ["Bin1", "Bin2"], "text": "I've got a sorting game for toddlers. Every triangle should be red from now on, and every square blue. Add two triangles above Bin1 and a square above Bin2. After that list the red ones, please.", "wires": [{"type": "rule", "args": {"shape": "triangle", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "rule", "args": {"shape": "square", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "triangle", "count": "2", "position": "above", "anchor": "Bin1"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "position": "above", "anchor": "Bin2"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "red"}}]}
{"id": "s-0159", "domain": "network diagram", "names": ["Dns", "Web", "Mail"], "text": "Okay, so uh the Dns box needs to be linked to the Web box and the Mail box, both ways, because of the replies. Then, uh, what's the degree of Dns? And should I make the Mail a hexagon? Yeah, do it.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Dns", "to": "Web,Mail", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "Dns"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mail", "shape": "hexagon"}}]}
{"id": "s-0160", "domain": "science lab", "names": ["Beaker", "Burner", "Flask"], "text": "Let's move the Beaker above the Burner, and the Flask to the right of the Beaker. Plain stuff. Colour the beaker cyan. Hmm, make it teal. Is the Flask above the Burner?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Beaker", "position": "above", "anchor": "Burner"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Flask", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Beaker"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Beaker", "color": "teal"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Flask", "position": "above", "anchor": "Burner"}}]}
{"id": "s-0161", "domain": "zoo", "names": ["Gate", "Lions"], "text": "Put 3 gray rectangles in a column on the left side, for the cages. After that, delete the last rectangle, the zoo can't afford it. Then hook the Gate to the first one. Wait, are there still two cages left?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "rectangle", "color": "gray", "count": "3", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,shape=rectangle)", "layout": "column"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "mention(recency=newest,shape=rectangle)"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Gate", "to": "mention(recency=oldest,shape=rectangle)"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "rectangle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0162", "domain": "fashion", "names": ["Dress", "Hat", "Shoes"], "text": "Paint every shape pink, it's a spring collection. Then make the Hat tiny and the Shoes small. And one more favour: tell me which one is the biggest.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(quantifier=all)", "color": "pink"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hat", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Shoes", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0163", "domain": "data science", "names": ["Raw", "Model", "Report"], "text": "Raw feeds Model, Model feeds Report. Thats the whole idea, draw it with dashed arrows. Also reccolor Model to indigo and make it big. Does a path run from Raw to Report?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Raw,Model,Report", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Model", "color": "indigo", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Raw", "to": "Report"}}]}
{"id": "s-0164", "domain": "floor plan", "names": ["Bed", "Desk"], "text": "My room is tiny. Please put a navy rectangle called Closet at the left, and a yellow circle called Lamp above the Desk. Then tell me which shape is the smallest, I suspect it's the Lamp. Also pull the Bed to the bottom right.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "rectangle", "color": "navy", "name": "Closet", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "yellow", "name": "Lamp", "position": "above", "anchor": "Desk"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "smallest"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Bed", "position": "bottomRight"}}]}
{"id": "s-0165", "domain": "robotics", "names": ["Sensor", "Brain", "Motor"], "text": "Sensor -> Brain -> Motor. Chain it. The Brain is a diamond, because it decides. And the Motor, can you turn it brown? Tell me what's connected to the Brain.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Sensor,Brain,Motor", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Brain", "shape": "diamond"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Motor", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Brain"}}]}
{"id": "s-0166", "domain": "kanban board", "names": ["Todo", "Done"], "text": "Add 5 small yellow squares in a grid, those are my tasks. Then move the newest square to the right of Done. And get rid of every blue shape, they belong to the other project. How many squares are left in the end?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "size": "small", "color": "yellow", "count": "5"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,shape=square)", "layout": "grid"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "mention(recency=newest,shape=square)", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Done"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "mention(color=blue,quantifier=all)"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "square"}}]}
{"id": "s-0167", "domain": "sky chart", "names": ["Orion", "Vega", "Polaris"], "text": "Make Orion a star shape and gold coloured. The two others, I mean Vega and Polaris, should be white stars as well. Please join Vega and Polaris with a plain line. I need to know the nearest one to Orion.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Orion", "shape": "star", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Vega,Polaris", "shape": "star", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Vega", "to": "Polaris", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Orion", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0168", "domain": "architecture", "names": ["Hall", "Wing1", "Wing2"], "text": "The building is symmetrical: Wing1 to the left of Hall, Wing2 to the right. Line up the three, then evenly distribute them horizontally. Colour both wings cyan. Is the Hall between them?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Wing1", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Hall"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Wing2", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Hall"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Hall,Wing1,Wing2", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Hall,Wing1,Wing2", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Wing1,Wing2", "color": "cyan"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Hall", "position": "between", "anchor": "Wing1,Wing2"}}]}
{"id": "s-0169", "domain": "customer support", "names": ["Chat", "Email", "Phone"], "text": "We got three channels for support, Chat, Email and Phone. Chat gets lime, Email gets blue, and Phone gets orange. Now that every shape has its colour, forget the rules please. Show me the rules afterwards.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Chat", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Email", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Phone", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "forget"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "rules"}}]}
{"id": "s-0170", "domain": "geometry class", "names": ["Tri", "Sq", "Circ"], "text": "Tri should be a triangle, Sq a square and Circ a circle. Fix the ones that aren't, thanks. Then, because the teacher wants it, label the triangle \"3\" and the square \"4\". Does the canvas have a circle?", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Tri", "shape": "triangle"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Sq", "shape": "square"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Circ", "shape": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "mention(shape=triangle)", "label": "3"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "mention(shape=square)", "label": "4"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "shape": "circle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0171", "domain": "startup", "names": ["Pitch", "Seed", "Series"], "text": "Chain Pitch, Seed and Series; investors love a clear path. The Seed is green, Series is gold, and Pitch is white. Is Series bigger than Seed? If it isn't, make it larger.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Pitch,Seed,Series", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Seed", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Series", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pitch", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Series", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Seed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Series"}}]}
{"id": "s-0172", "domain": "automotive", "names": ["Engine", "Gearbox", "Wheels"], "text": "Power flows from the Engine to the Gearbox and then to the Wheels. I would love arrows for it. Put the three in a row, and make the Engine huge and red, because it is a big deal. What shape is the Wheels?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Engine,Gearbox,Wheels", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Engine,Gearbox,Wheels", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Engine", "size": "huge", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Wheels", "property": "shape"}}]}
{"id": "s-0173", "domain": "data center", "names": ["Rack", "Ups", "Cooler"], "text": "Sorry for the multiple asks. First, move Cooler to the top. Second, hook the Ups to the Rack with an arrow. Third, duplicate the Rack 2 times so we get three. Last one: is Ups near Rack?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Cooler", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Ups", "to": "Rack"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Rack", "count": "2"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Ups", "position": "near", "anchor": "Rack"}}]}
{"id": "s-0174", "domain": "school play", "names": ["Hero", "Villain", "Narrator"], "text": "Narrator sits at the far left, Hero in the middle, Villain far right. Move them so. Make the Villain black and the Hero white; classic. Then tell me what is the leftmost shape, just in case.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Narrator", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Hero", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Villain", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Villain", "color": "black"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hero", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leftmost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0175", "domain": "hr onboarding", "names": ["Contract", "Laptop", "Desk"], "text": "New hire process: after the Contract the person gets a Laptop, and then a Desk. Connect them in sequence. The Laptop is gray and medium sized, I think. Please add a green circle named Welcome above the Contract and link it to the Contract.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Contract,Laptop,Desk", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Laptop", "color": "gray", "size": "medium"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "green", "name": "Welcome", "position": "above", "anchor": "Contract"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "$new", "to": "Contract"}}]}
