{"id": "s-0179", "domain": "network", "names": ["Edge", "Core", "Dist"], "text": "Don't forget to swap Edge and Dist, the labels were mixed up. Next, push Core to the center. All boxes that are not gray should turn gray, I'm printing in black and white. Is anything left that isn't gray?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "swap", "target": "Edge,Dist"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Core", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(notcolor=gray,quantifier=all,shape=rectangle)", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "notColor": "gray"}}]}
