{"id": "s-0185", "domain": "ecology", "names": ["Sun", "Plant", "Cow"], "text": "The Sun gives energy to the Plant, and the Plant gives it to the Cow. I'm making a poster. Arrows please, and the Plant green, the Cow brown. Who is farthest away from the Sun?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Sun,Plant,Cow", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Plant", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cow", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Sun", "superlative": "farthest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0186", "domain": "IT", "names": ["Printer", "Server"], "text": "Add a triangle named Warn near the Printer, colour it yellow. Link it to the Server with a dotted line and give that line the label \"low ink\". I don't need arrowheads for that. Can you tell me if Warn is yellow?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "triangle", "color": "yellow", "name": "Warn", "position": "near", "anchor": "Printer"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "$new", "to": "Server", "style": "dotted", "arrow": "none", "label": "low ink"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "$new", "color": "yellow"}}]}
{"id": "s-0187", "domain": "political map", "names": ["North", "South", "East", "West"], "text": "Put North at the top, South at the bottom, East right and West left. Easy compass. The four directions are circles, all of them. Make East red. Whoa, I mean orange. Is North above South?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "North", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "South", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "East", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "West", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "North,South,East,West", "shape": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "East", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "North", "position": "above", "anchor": "South"}}]}
{"id": "s-0188", "domain": "photography", "names": ["Studio", "Backdrop"], "text": "Create two gray umbrellas, I mean two gray triangles, near the Studio. Then toss the Backdrop to the back. Does the Studio have any gray neighbors?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "triangle", "color": "gray", "count": "2", "position": "near", "anchor": "Studio"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Backdrop"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "gray", "position": "near", "anchor": "Studio"}}]}
{"id": "s-0189", "domain": "translation", "names": ["En", "Fr", "De"], "text": "Translations go En to Fr and En to De. Make it with arrows, and tag the first with \"fr\" and the second with \"de\". Hmm, labels might be too cluttered, skip the tags. Colour En navy.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "En", "to": "Fr,De"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "En", "color": "navy"}}]}
{"id": "s-0190", "domain": "farm", "names": ["Cow", "Hen", "Pig"], "text": "Let's group the Cow, the Hen and the Pig in a circle layout. They are friends. Make the Hen small, and the Pig pink. And do you see a cycle, because I connected nothing?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Cow,Hen,Pig", "layout": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hen", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pig", "color": "pink"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0191", "domain": "workflow", "names": ["Draft", "Review", "Publish"], "text": "If the Review fails, we go back to Draft, so connect Review to Draft. And the pass case is Review to Publish, of course. Draft is white, Publish is green. Does that create a cycle?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Review", "to": "Draft"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Review", "to": "Publish"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Draft", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Publish", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0192", "domain": "sound", "names": ["Wave", "Echo"], "text": "A wave hits a wall and comes back as an echo. So Wave to Echo with a dashed two-way arrow. Make the Echo tiny and the Wave medium. Place the Echo below the Wave. Tell me how Echo's position is relative to Wave.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Wave", "to": "Echo", "style": "dashed", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Echo", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Wave", "size": "medium"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Echo", "position": "below", "anchor": "Wave"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Echo", "property": "position"}}]}
{"id": "s-0193", "domain": "retail", "names": ["Shelf", "Scanner", "Pos"], "text": "Make the red ones bigger, I can't see them. Also hook Scanner to Pos. And hmm, let me toss in 2 huge blue diamonds at the top. What is the total number of shapes now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "mention(color=red,quantifier=all)"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Scanner", "to": "Pos"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "diamond", "color": "blue", "size": "huge", "count": "2", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
{"id": "s-0194", "domain": "fitness", "names": ["Warmup", "Lift", "Cooldown"], "text": "Warmup, Lift, Cooldown: three blocks for my routine. Drop them in a column and connect them in order. The Lift is the hard one, so make it large and red. Is the Warmup at the top?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Warmup,Lift,Cooldown", "layout": "column"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Warmup,Lift,Cooldown", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Lift", "size": "large", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Warmup", "position": "top"}}]}
{"id": "s-0195", "domain": "accounting", "names": ["Invoice", "Ledger"], "text": "Invoices go into the Ledger. Draw the arrow from Invoice to Ledger. Add a cyan ellipse called Tax right of Ledger and point the Ledger at it. Also put the newest shape at the front.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Invoice", "to": "Ledger"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "ellipse", "color": "cyan", "name": "Tax", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Ledger"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Ledger", "to": "$new"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "mention(recency=newest)"}}]}
{"id": "s-0196", "domain": "mountain hike", "names": ["Camp", "Peak", "Lake"], "text": "The trail goes from Camp to Lake to Peak, so connect them that way. Make the Peak a triangle, and white, since it has snow. Do me a favour and nudge Lake left by 25 pixels, please.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Camp,Lake,Peak", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Peak", "shape": "triangle", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Lake", "direction": "left", "distance": "25"}}]}
{"id": "s-0197", "domain": "events", "names": ["Stage", "Tent"], "text": "Place four small teal circles for the speakers in a row. Then I want them evenly spread, so distribute them horizontally. Put the Tent above the first circle and the Stage below the last one. Are all of them still teal?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "size": "small", "color": "teal", "count": "4"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,shape=circle)", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,shape=circle)", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Tent", "position": "above", "anchor": "mention(recency=oldest,shape=circle)"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Stage", "position": "below", "anchor": "mention(recency=newest,shape=circle)"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "notColor": "teal", "shape": "circle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0198", "domain": "neural net", "names": ["In", "Hidden", "Out"], "text": "In, Hidden, Out are the layers. Wire them as a chain and make the middle layer bigger. All the arrows should be dotted, ok? Hidden is purple and Out is orange. Which one has the most connections?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "In,Hidden,Out", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Hidden"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hidden", "color": "purple"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Out", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0199", "domain": "pets", "names": ["Dog", "Cat"], "text": "Dog and Cat don't get along, so put them far apart: Dog in the bottom left and Cat in the top right. Make the Dog brown. Make the Cat gray. Make the room a bit bigger? I mean enlarge the Cat.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Dog", "position": "bottomLeft"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Cat", "position": "topRight"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dog", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cat", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Cat"}}]}
{"id": "s-0200", "domain": "web analytics", "names": ["Visit", "Click", "Buy"], "text": "Funnel time: Visit, Click, Buy. Chain them, and shrink each step compared to the last. I guess just shrink Click and Buy. Which one is the smallest then?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Visit,Click,Buy", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Click"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Buy"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "smallest"}}]}
